flowchart TD
    Pitcher[pitcher_pitch_call_proposals] --> Reconcile[reconcile_pitch_call_proposals]
    Catcher[catcher_pitch_call_proposals] --> Reconcile
    Weight["捕手側の重み：初期値 0.5"] --> Reconcile
    Reconcile --> Shared{"共通候補あり？"}
    Shared -->|あり| Score["双方のスコアを重み付き平均"]
    Score --> Best["最大スコアの候補"]
    Shared -->|なし| Fallback["投手の最良案、なければ捕手案"]
    Best --> Decision["PitchCallDecision：選択理由・双方のスコア"]
    Fallback --> Decision
    Decision --> Call[PitchCall]
